EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}"The shortest day of the year."{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Hearing that when I was a kid
would always get me excited!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It made me think I could start
staying up even past sunset!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Nowadays{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}it just feels like a safety
hazard that I don't wanna deal with!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Ugh. It's hard becoming an adult.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}"El día más corto del año."{{TAG:0000:0004:}}De niño oía eso y pensaba:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
"¡Podré acostarme después
de que anochezca!".{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ahora solo pienso en el frío
que hace por las noches.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Creo que me estoy haciendo viejo
pero de verdad.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}"Il giorno più corto dell'anno"...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Quando sentivo queste parole
da piccolo... impazzivo dalla gioia!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Potevo finalmente restare alzato
dopo il tramonto! Urrà!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Oggigiorno{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} la prima cosa che mi
viene in mente è: "Che noia, farà
buio pesto ancora prima di cena!".
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} senti come parlo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono
diventato un vecchietto lamentoso!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}"Yılın en kısa günü."{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Çocukken bunu duymak beni hep heyecanlandırırdı!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Güneş battıktan sonra bile daha çok ayakta
kalabilirim sanırdım!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Şimdiyse{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}sadece
uğraşmak istemediğim bir güvenlik
riski gibi geliyor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Off. Yetişkin olmak zor.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Im Winter wird's ja erst später
hell, aber mir ist das ziemlich egal.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ich schlafe sowieso immer bis um
12, wenn's geht!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
No sé si será porque hay menos
horas de sol,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}} {{TAG:0003:000A:}}¡pero hoy tengo el
frío metido en el cuerpo!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}En fin, quejarme no va a ayudar.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Será mejor pensar en otra cosa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
